---
import SiteLayout from '../layouts/SiteLayout.astro';
import Button from '../components/Button.astro';
import Logo from '../components/Logo.astro';
import InquiryForm from '../components/InquiryForm.astro';
import {services} from '../data/services.js';
import {offerings} from '../data/service-details.js';
const base=import.meta.env.BASE_URL;
---
<SiteLayout title="Branding, Writing & Creative Services" description="Branding, writing and editing, graphic design, photography, public relations, digital content, and websites for small businesses and organizations.">
<section class="hero" aria-labelledby="hero-title"><div class="hero-watermark"><Logo decorative/></div><div class="wrap hero-content"><p class="eyebrow">BRANDING & CREATIVE SERVICES</p><h1 id="hero-title">YOUR STORY,<br/>YOUR WAY.</h1><p class="intro">Branding, writing, design, and digital content that help your business tell its story.</p><p class="hero-audience">Creative services for small businesses, entrepreneurs, and organizations.</p><div class="actions"><Button href="#contact">Discuss your project</Button><a class="text-link" href="#services">View services <span aria-hidden="true">↓</span></a></div></div></section>
<section id="services" class="services section"><div class="wrap"><div class="section-head"><div><p class="eyebrow">HOW WE CAN HELP</p><h2>SERVICES</h2></div><p>From a logo cleanup to a new website, choose the support your project needs. Each project is scoped individually and quoted after consultation.</p></div><div class="service-grid">{services.map((s,i)=><article class="service" id={s.id}><h3>{s.title}</h3><p>{s.description}</p><ul class="service-preview">{offerings[i].slice(0,4).map(item=><li>{item}</li>)}</ul><details class="service-details"><summary>View all {offerings[i].length} services</summary><ul>{offerings[i].slice(4).map(item=><li>{item}</li>)}</ul></details>{i===2&&<p class="service-note">Photography location and availability are discussed during consultation.</p>}</article>)}</div><a class="catalog-link" href={base+'services/'}>Explore the complete service catalog <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></div></section>
<section id="about" class="wrap section about-grid"><div><p class="eyebrow">ABOUT THE STUDIO</p><h2>ABOUT<br/>ODD PHOENIX</h2></div><div><p class="large-copy">Writing, design, and visual storytelling, brought together around your goals.</p><p>Odd Phoenix Creative Company helps small businesses, entrepreneurs, nonprofits, and community organizations communicate through clear writing, thoughtful design, and visual content.</p><p>The founder brings nearly eight years of combined U.S. Army Public Affairs experience in journalism, photography, multimedia production, and community relations.</p><ul class="credentials"><li>More than 150 published news and feature articles</li><li>Content development for the Show Me Fort Leonard Wood WordPress blog, which reached more than 200,000 readers</li><li>Photography recognition at command and Department of the Army levels</li></ul><p>That professional foundation informs a practical approach to branding, creative work, and business communication.</p><a class="text-link" href={base+'about/'}>More about the studio <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></div></section>
<section id="contact" class="inquiry-section section"><div class="wrap"><div class="inquiry-grid"><div><p class="eyebrow">CONTACT</p><h2>DISCUSS<br/>YOUR PROJECT</h2><p>Tell us what you need help with. You don’t need a finished brief to start a conversation.</p><ol class="consultation"><li><strong>INQUIRE</strong><p>Share your project and goals.</p></li><li><strong>CONSULT</strong><p>We’ll discuss your needs and project scope.</p></li><li><strong>QUOTE</strong><p>Receive a customized proposal.</p></li><li><strong>CREATE</strong><p>Once approved, we’ll get to work.</p></li></ol></div><div><InquiryForm/></div></div></div></section>
</SiteLayout>
